00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:36,000
In 1994 a 13-year-old boy disappeared without a trace
from his home in San Antonio, Texas.

4
00:22:00,000 --> 00:22:06,000
Three-and-a-half years later he is found alive thousands of miles away in a village
in southern Spain with a horrifying story of kidnap and torture.

5
00:27:30,000 --> 00:27:36,000
His family is overjoyed to bring him home.

